              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe aphume aye e-altare eliphambi kukaJehova, alenze isihlawulelo; uthathe igazi lenkunzi nasegazini lempongo, ulisakaze ezimpondweni ze-altare.",
          "type": "text",
