          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe ageze umzimba wakhe endlini engcwele ngamanzi, agqoke izingubo zakhe, aphume anikele ngomnikelo wakhe wokushiswa nomnikelo wokushiswa wabantu, azenzele yena nabantu isihlawulelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
