            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kuyakuba yisimiso kini esiphakade: ngenyanga yesikhombisa ngosuku lweshumi lwenyanga niyocindezela imiphefumulo yenu, ningasebenzi msebenzi, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi ungowakini noma ungowezizwe. Ohlala phakathi kwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
